heist success target -> gap below target: + steelblue
actual heist success rate -> gap below target: - steelblue
gap below target -> corrective action: + steelblue
corrective action -> actual heist success rate: + delay steelblue
gap below target -> pressure to lower the target: + steelblue
pressure to lower the target -> heist success target: - steelblue

loop: gap below target, corrective action, actual heist success rate
loop: gap below target, pressure to lower the target, heist success target
